<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Aula Virtual - Seleccionar Materia</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] min-h-screen p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-xl border border-purple-900/30">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-white mb-6">Mis Aulas Virtuales</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-center mb-6">Selecciona una materia a la que estés inscripto o hayas aprobado para ver sus novedades.</p>

        <form action="/estudiante/aula-virtual/materia" method="get" class="space-y-4">
            <div>
                <label for="materia_codigo" class="block text-[#ccd0fc] text-sm font-medium mb-1">Materia:</label>
                <select id="materia_codigo" name="materia_codigo" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-md bg-white text-gray-900 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500">
                    <option value="">-- Seleccionar Materia --</option>
                    {{#materias}}
                    <option value="{{codigo}}">[{{codigo}}] {{nombre}} (Estado: {{estado}})</option>
                    {{/materias}}
                </select>
                {{^materias}}
                <p class="text-red-400 text-sm mt-2">No estás inscripto en ninguna materia actualmente.</p>
                {{/materias}}
            </div>
            
            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-purple-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-purple-700 transition duration-300">
                Ingresar al Aula
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="text-center mt-6">
            <a href="/dashboard" class="text-purple-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">Volver al Panel</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>